id: webgl-cube
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: WebGL on the GPU path: jihad-webgl-cube.html's cube turns (its ticker counts), a pinch and a pan over the canvas keep it drawn (content in the canvas region)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-webgl-cube.html
kit: cavekit-gpu-rendering.md R8
wait rect c 30
calibrate out
expect text-has out webgl
expect content c c
wait changed c 5
pinch 384 400 150 300
wait zoom 10
drag 480 800 480 500
expect content 0,100,768,900 c
wait changed c 5
